<title>USA: New York physical copper market - Aug 5.</title>
<headline>New York physical copper market - Aug 5.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Based on COMEX settlement prices, merchant copper cathodes for August shipment were quoted at a nominal 109.75 to 110.00 cents a lb.</p>
<p>Dealers quoted No.2 scrap copper at a nominal 84.00 cents per lb, unchanged from August 4th. ((New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640))</p>
</text>
